nsion}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}condition\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ConditionExtension}_S(q,p,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land q\\in\\mathbb P\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}condition\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ConditionExtension}_S(q,p,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land q\\in\\mathbb P\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extension is now explicitly membership in the sourced poset relation; the unrelated generic <code>extension</code> dependency was removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"